413	      <tr>
414	        <td class="net-name c-yellow">TD+</td>
415	        <td>R2.2 → <b>L1.1</b>（变压器Pin1） + D1.2 + D2.2</td>
416	        <td>经5.1Ω(R2)后进变压器，同时连ESD D1/D2阳极</td>
417	      </tr>
418	      <tr>
419	        <td class="net-name c-yellow">TD-</td>
420	        <td>R3.2 → <b>L1.3</b>（变压器Pin3） + D2.1 + D3.2</td>
